      "writtenOn": "2019-10-23T19:54:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve moved them to a new struct called FuzzOptions.\n\nWe want the keep things in the build file (instead of a config file) for two reasons:\n* this brings us to parity with other fuzzing infrastructure at Google which use build files for this data\n* to ensure the options are correct at submission, instead of failing at runtime (if an author checked in an invalid config file)",
      "parentUuid": "1fb70746_88806218",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 42,
        "endChar": 17
      },
